# Deferred, link chip

- `family-icons.ts` holds copies of lucide shapes (`scroll`, `feather`,
  `library`, `user`, `notebook-pen`, `upload`, `file`, `file-plus`) taken from
  lucide-react 1.21.0. Chip and sidebar read the same copy, so they never
  disagree with each other, but a lucide upgrade that redraws one of these
  leaves the family icons on the old drawing beside the app's other lucide
  icons. A test that renders each installed lucide component and compares its
  SVG children with the copy would flag the upgrade.
